  <_summary>Legacy-friendly multiprotocol instant messaging</_summary>
  <description>
    <_p>Amethyst Messenger preserves classic desktop messaging on historical operating systems. It is derived from Pidgin 2.11.0 and connects to MSN through CrossTalk.</_p>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/ProjectCrystalROM/AmethystMessenger</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/ProjectCrystalROM/AmethystMessenger/issues</url>
</application>
